# SCSS Tokens

- Prefer existing CSS custom properties and shared SCSS tokens before introducing new raw values.
- Check `packages/excalidraw/css/variables.module.scss`, `packages/excalidraw/css/theme.scss`, and nearby component styles for existing tokens first.
- New reusable colors, spacing, radii, and sizing values should become shared tokens instead of repeated literals.
- Raw literals are acceptable for one-off alpha blends, shadows, or browser-specific values when no existing token expresses the intent.
